<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>faucet_withdraw(balance, request, limit)</code></strong>. If <code>request</code> is greater than <code>limit</code>, return the string <code>"Withdrawal too big"</code>. Otherwise, if <code>request</code> is greater than <code>balance</code>, return <code>"Insufficient funds"</code>. Otherwise pay out and return the integer new balance (<code>balance - request</code>). Check the limit first.</p>]]></text>
